{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/5cff653111c5736502965c6a56441652.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=182 /></span><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You roll into the chaotic, low-poly city of <strong>New Raxon</strong> with nothing but a beat-up van and a contact number. Your mission? Deliver high-risk, illegal cargo for cartels, corrupt politicians, crime lords, and underground media networks\u2014all while dodging cops, planning the fastest routes, and building your black-market empire with your crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>Plan B</strong>\u2014a wild physics-based TPS/FPS co-op simulator where every delivery is a gamble\u2026 and every dollar is dirty.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/9aa727ca1590f7622488dd1ec0d11d2c.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cartel shipments to sensitive political files, every job is shady. Use stealth or speed to drop the package and disappear before the heat catches up.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/3e47728cc3cf97e1fba752a6ee48f635.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect roadblocks, undercover cops, drones, and sabotage from rival gangs. One wrong turn and it\u2019s a full-blown citywide pursuit.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/682830e7d057126bdfec5d6dedefc0cc.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with 3 friends and take on contracts together.Stack missions, plan diversions, and pull off deliveries like a real crew.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/4f2103aad3f12941310624f746dba1a2.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts. Use your GPS, street instincts, and city knowledge to avoid heat and hit deadlines. The fastest way isn't always the safest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/15f35fd35b30908b840524841da89a9e.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=234 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crate, vehicle, and collision is physics-driven. Deliveries can fall, flip, or explode\u2014your skills decide whether it's a clean drop-off or total disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/c7ff573c3ec2e63d683de65f3ae0201e.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=234 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small. Work your way up. Buy stash houses, upgrade vehicles, hire fixers, and unlock secret delivery tech to automate your underground empire.<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan B</strong> isn\u2019t just about crime\u2014it\u2019s about control.</p><br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792730?t=1756051725","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/c1fffe7cefd7c412d0823afe16e9519806ea9bbe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756051725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/e1fa6b5b5f842f83b8fa26eaeeb5e2eea58b9791/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756051725","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/e1fa6b5b5f842f83b8fa26eaeeb5e2eea58b9791/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756051725","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/5cff653111c5736502965c6a56441652.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=182 /></span><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You roll into the chaotic, low-poly city of <strong>New Raxon</strong> with nothing but a beat-up van and a contact number. Your mission? Deliver high-risk, illegal cargo for cartels, corrupt politicians, crime lords, and underground media networks\u2014all while dodging cops, planning the fastest routes, and building your black-market empire with your crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>Plan B</strong>\u2014a wild physics-based TPS/FPS co-op simulator where every delivery is a gamble\u2026 and every dollar is dirty.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/9aa727ca1590f7622488dd1ec0d11d2c.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cartel shipments to sensitive political files, every job is shady. Use stealth or speed to drop the package and disappear before the heat catches up.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/3e47728cc3cf97e1fba752a6ee48f635.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect roadblocks, undercover cops, drones, and sabotage from rival gangs. One wrong turn and it\u2019s a full-blown citywide pursuit.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/682830e7d057126bdfec5d6dedefc0cc.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with 3 friends and take on contracts together.Stack missions, plan diversions, and pull off deliveries like a real crew.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/4f2103aad3f12941310624f746dba1a2.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts. Use your GPS, street instincts, and city knowledge to avoid heat and hit deadlines. The fastest way isn't always the safest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/15f35fd35b30908b840524841da89a9e.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=234 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crate, vehicle, and collision is physics-driven. Deliveries can fall, flip, or explode\u2014your skills decide whether it's a clean drop-off or total disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/c7ff573c3ec2e63d683de65f3ae0201e.avif?t=1756051725\" width=800 height=234 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small. Work your way up. Buy stash houses, upgrade vehicles, hire fixers, and unlock secret delivery tech to automate your underground empire.<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan B</strong> isn\u2019t just about crime\u2014it\u2019s about control.</p><br>","developers":["Paff Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/ee15ca7e8e7a060e7bee982db1bebed25905023f/header.jpg?t=1756051725","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792730/904502753/52b051ad6e5d3636f2b7c2dd2e352a6b1ef0f1b8/1756050749/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756051718","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792730/904502753/52b051ad6e5d3636f2b7c2dd2e352a6b1ef0f1b8/1756050749/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756051718","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792730/904502753/52b051ad6e5d3636f2b7c2dd2e352a6b1ef0f1b8/1756050749/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756051718","id":257188021,"name":"First Trailer: Plan B","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188021/e34faff8fa9e995a691de3e92c812931e6bd793a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756051718"}],"name":"Plan B","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz 4-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or Radeon RX 580<b